<title>UK: Green sterling to revalue on Tuesday - HGCA.</title>
<headline>Green sterling to revalue on Tuesday - HGCA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The green rate used by the European Union (EU) to convert Ecu into sterling will be revalued on Tuesday, the UK's Home Grown Cereals Authority (HGCA) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new rate is 0.768177 per Ecu, compared with the previous rate of 0.809915, the HGCA said.</p>
</text>
